&lt;h2 id=&#34;-the-problem-every-ai-developer-faces&#34;&gt;🎯 The Problem Every AI Developer Faces
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;You build an AI agent. It works great in testing. Then real users start talking to it and&amp;hellip;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;❌ It ignores your carefully crafted system prompts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;❌ It hallucinates responses in critical moments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;❌ It can&amp;rsquo;t handle edge cases consistently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;❌ Each conversation feels like a roll of the dice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound familiar?&lt;/strong&gt; You&amp;rsquo;re not alone. This is the #1 pain point for developers building production AI agents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;-the-solution-stop-fighting-prompts-teach-principles&#34;&gt;⚡ The Solution: Stop Fighting Prompts, Teach Principles
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Parlant flips the script on AI agent development. Instead of hoping your LLM will follow instructions, &lt;strong&gt;Parlant ensures it&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;9
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-python&#34; data-lang=&#34;python&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# Traditional approach: Cross your fingers 🤞&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;system_prompt&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;You are a helpful assistant. Please follow these 47 rules...&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# Parlant approach: Ensured compliance ✅&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;await&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;agent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;create_guideline&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;condition&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Customer asks about refunds&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;action&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Check order status first to see if eligible&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;tools&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;check_order_status&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;],&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;✅ &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.parlant.io/blog/how-parlant-guarantees-compliance&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Blog: How Parlant Ensures Agent Compliance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🆚 &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.parlant.io/blog/parlant-vs-dspy&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Blog: Parlant vs DSPy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&#34;parlant-gives-you-all-the-structure-you-need-to-build-customer-facing-agents-that-behave-exactly-as-your-business-requires&#34;&gt;Parlant gives you all the structure you need to build customer-facing agents that behave exactly as your business requires:
&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://parlant.io/docs/concepts/customization/journeys&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Journeys&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;:
Define clear customer journeys and how your agent should respond at each step.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://parlant.io/docs/concepts/customization/guidelines&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Behavioral Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;:
Easily craft agent behavior; Parlant will match the relevant elements contextually.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://parlant.io/docs/concepts/customization/tools&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Tool Use&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;:
Attach external APIs, data fetchers, or backend services to specific interaction events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://parlant.io/docs/concepts/customization/glossary&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Domain Adaptation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;:
Teach your agent domain-specific terminology and craft personalized responses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://parlant.io/docs/concepts/customization/canned-responses&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Canned Responses&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;:
Use response templates to eliminate hallucinations and guarantee style consistency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://parlant.io/docs/advanced/explainability&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Explainability&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;:
Understand why and when each guideline was matched and followed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;-get-your-agent-running-in-60-seconds&#34;&gt;🚀 Get Your Agent Running in 60 Seconds
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
